    </node>
    <node id="MOTHER'S BEAUTY">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Mother's Beauty refers to the incomparable beauty attributed to the boy's mother, which is reflected in his features.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0b7e17d68c274e247f9a92e0dfa7535a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PARTY">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Party is a group of individuals traveling together, with members taking turns to watch and protect each other.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dd3d00f92506b4a248933f3150a7352a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MARTIAN TIME">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Martian Time refers to the temporal measurement system on Mars, which differs from Earth's time, impacting the perception of years and days.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-23577b33daf3c193d9b0f1a6043134a9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NARRATOR">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The Narrator is a character who vows to rescue and revenge Dejah Thoris, demonstrating self-confidence and leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator is an individual who experiences interplanetary travel, finding themselves in an unfamiliar world, expressing fear and uncertainty about their location.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator is the individual who is imprisoned and receives food from a jailer, expressing chagrin and disappointment when Parthak is replaced.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator is the main character, who fought alongside their companion and is now trapped beneath the arena.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator is the individual recounting the events and conversations, and they have a close relationship with their uncle, as indicated by the term "nephew."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-700a9ecf3a90c20ff6154b43291d211a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbf3e1c6948f435061f05af1af6eefd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-906dc67c04c5c3c54cafff91f6bf6a60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a229c550121312c4db9f9bbe4adbb4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8827d6c7791b3b800c1f7855d869b563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UNCLE">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The Uncle is a character who has experienced significant, possibly life-threatening events and has documented these experiences in notes over the last three months. He believes the world is not ready to understand or accept his findings.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-700a9ecf3a90c20ff6154b43291d211a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MARTIAN JEDDAK'S COURT">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Martian Jeddak's court refers to a place known for its barbaric splendors and vibrant decorations, influencing the perception of the scene.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2bf22396435379360201facb4abd270f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NOTES">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Notes refer to the collection of writings left by Captain John Carter, which provide insights into his experiences and story related to Mars.&lt;SEP&gt;The Notes are a collection of writings by the Uncle, documenting his experiences and discoveries over the past three months, which he believes are beyond the current comprehension of Earth men.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-700a9ecf3a90c20ff6154b43291d211a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73f568e5559307a47b8b95fa17fa316c</data>
    </node>
