    <node id="SECRET PANEL">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Secret Panel is a hidden mechanism in the room that offers potential escape, but its lock is elusive and challenging to negotiate.&lt;SEP&gt;The Secret Panel is a hidden passageway used by characters to move between rooms discreetly.&lt;SEP&gt;The Secret Panel refers to a hidden entrance or passage within the wall, suggesting clandestine activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The secret panel in the wall is a hidden passageway through which the protagonist had entered, now closed and inaccessible.</data>
