    <node id="THE MOTHER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The Mother is a character whose descriptions of another person have influenced The Boy's perception and belief in the identity of that person.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mother is the narrator's partner, whose incomparable beauty is reflected in their son, and her absence has deeply affected the narrator.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ebe383ebeaef8c182ef68112da6f7629&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca4fd0f96467b5e870a8b2eb9b2d163</data>
