    <node id="RESCUE MISSION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Rescue Mission involves a planned operation to save the Princess from the Temple of Issus, showcasing a high-stakes endeavor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rescue Mission is John Carter's endeavor to save Dejah Thoris from Issus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rescue Mission refers to the potential endeavor to save the narrator, involving reaching Matai Shang and finding a way to rescue them.</data>
