    </node>
    <node id="FIRST BORN OF BARSOOM">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The First Born of Barsoom is a group or organization associated with Xodar, indicating a societal structure on Barsoom.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Born of Barsoom is a group or race associated with Xodar and possibly linked to a hierarchy on Barsoom.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Born of Barsoom is a group or race known for their combat skills and honor, as mentioned in the context of fighting.</data>
