    </node>
    <node id="I">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The narrator is experiencing intense emotions and physical strain while being pursued by cowardly beasts.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator who is exploring a strange shaft and climbing a ladder, demonstrating curiosity and caution.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator who is recounting their experience of a life-threatening struggle with another individual on a ship.</data>
