    </node>
    <node id="GREEN MEN OF BARSOOM">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Green Men of Barsoom are a distinct species characterized by their glossy green hide, unique physical features like antennae-like ears, and multiple arms. They belong to various tribes or hordes known for being in perpetual conflict with one another.</data>
