    </node>
    <node id="THE SEA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The Sea is a vast body of water extending as far as the eye can see, forming part of the landscape described.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sea is described as larger than Korus, receiving waters from a lesser sea, and is managed by pumping stations to regulate its water levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The sea below the ship, into which the other individual falls and ultimately drowns.</data>
