    </node>
    <node id="GREAT WHITE APES OF BARSOOM">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Great White Apes of Barsoom are creatures inhabiting the ancient cities of Mars, adding to the historical and mythical elements of the setting.&lt;SEP&gt;The Great White Apes of Barsoom are described as the most dreaded creatures on Mars, responding to a call alongside plant men.</data>
