    <node id="THE RED MAN OF BARSOOM">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The red man of Barsoom is a character who attempts to leap onto a wall and is assisted by the narrator, showing determination and physical prowess.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43de1e21bfa0068e5a696fbdd9d723aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GREEN MEN">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Green Men are a group with whom Sola is associated, and they have formal greeting customs.&lt;SEP&gt;Green Men are a race described as savages from the water places of Barsoom, known for their conflicts with other races.&lt;SEP&gt;Green Men are described as fierce hordes that have preyed upon other races as the seas receded on the planet, indicating their role as a formidable force.&lt;SEP&gt;Green men are wild hordes that inhabit Barsoom and rely on milk-giving shrubs for sustenance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Men are a group of warriors who were advancing in ranks but became disordered and panicked after an unexpected attack.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Men are another group on Barsoom, implied to be involved in the pursuit of Tars Tarkas and Thuvia.&lt;SEP&gt;The green men are a group or species native to Barsoom, known for consuming milk-giving shrubs for sustenance.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5a7a16642255b39659c194a76a94b26b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70f2bbb44eb678dedfd2d193e527d2bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71af797a3da71bfc14e67053629a5b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2a40b4b5725576e6c332e92d2fc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150a32741024f15fa5faa16e08c5f878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fdc3026e0bed9c169e49b431d71e5e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7f78c9ccb74063a56ce56a2e1d5bafe</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FRIGHTFUL HERD">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Frightful Herd is a group of creatures with powerful tails and shrill screeching sounds, capable of causing terror and confusion among their prey.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-68a066689ab8b7599bbec5a36e42af40</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BATTLESHIP">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Battleship is a large vessel equipped with powerful water propellers, capable of descending into the depths of Barsoom's subterranean sea.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battleship is a large vessel seen clearing the tops of the hills, possibly responsible for the unexpected attack on the Green Men.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battleship is a large vessel within a fleet, from which the protagonist was removed by the guard.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battleship is a large warship involved in aerial warfare, with a boarding party prepared to swarm the deck of the protagonist's vessel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battleship is a large, majestic vessel flying the device of Helium, indicating its role as a significant and powerful presence in the scene.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e7b33af041481ac0fa8f2a1a4f22e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2a40b4b5725576e6c332e92d2fc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f890217e0a0643b024f03067d85c909c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9878ed9daf1be8baa0b54fae98e5e4a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89588704ee3cae64e0a062cefc137f80</data>
    </node>
