      <data key="d2">chunk-1fdc3026e0bed9c169e49b431d71e5e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ATTACK">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Attack is a planned onslaught by the Fleet, characterized by its speed and surprise, leading to a strategic breakthrough.&lt;SEP&gt;The Attack is an unexpected offensive action, possibly initiated by the Battleship, causing the Green Men to retreat.&lt;SEP&gt;The Attack refers to the event initiated by the Herald's call, involving the demons rushing towards the party on the riverbank.&lt;SEP&gt;The attack refers to the fusillade of shots fired by the Lesser Therns at the narrator and their companions in the storeroom.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-efd3e0d93de6c86499fed72eef65713e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a8ef909cf6cea9004f4cf2ca39dc840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2a40b4b5725576e6c332e92d2fc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc1af42c648e773e967ffc620ac03772</data>
    </node>
