      <data key="d1">The Green Warrior is a fierce combatant engaged in a life-threatening struggle, demonstrating bravery and skill in battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Warrior is a formidable fighter, skilled with a long-sword, and characterized by bravery in the face of overwhelming odds.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Warrior is a mighty and towering figure who is part of the group.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Warrior is a skilled and formidable fighter who joins the narrator in battle, using impressive combat techniques to defeat opponents.</data>
