    <node id="BLACK PIRATES OF BARSOOM">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Black Pirates of Barsoom are a formidable group known for their victorious attacks across the domain of the therns, often engaging in simultaneous battles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates of Barsoom are a group that preys upon the Holy Therns, engaging in raids for arms, ammunition, and prisoners.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates of Barsoom are feared by the therns, indicating their potential threat and power.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates of Barsoom are introduced as a group, presumably antagonistic, involved in the events unfolding in the story.&lt;SEP&gt;The black pirates of Barsoom are a group of warriors involved in a battle against the therns, characterized by their aggressive tactics and success in capturing young women.</data>
