    <node id="LAND OF THE FIRST BORN">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Land of the First Born is a location where adventures involving John Carter and others take place.&lt;SEP&gt;Land of the First Born is another location from which John Carter has returned, also described as a place of false hope, torture, and death.&lt;SEP&gt;Land of the First Born is another location mentioned by John Carter as part of his journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Land of the First Born is a location mentioned as unwelcoming to outsiders, particularly a 'green one'.&lt;SEP&gt;The Land of the First Born is a location where certain individuals are not permitted, as indicated by the guard's actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Land of the First Born is the intended destination for the fighting men gathered in Thark, where they plan to engage in battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Land of the First Born is the region where the Golden Temple of Issus is situated, known for its connection to the First Born people.</data>
