    <node id="PRINCE OF HELIUM">
      <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
      <data key="d1">Prince of Helium is the title held by John Carter, indicating his noble status and leadership role in Helium.&lt;SEP&gt;Prince of Helium is the title held by John Carter, indicating his status and significance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a central figure in the conflict, representing a leadership position that commands loyalty from the fleets involved in the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a central figure whose colors represent his authority and leadership in battles against enemies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a character from another world, indicating a royal status and an outsider's perspective in the context of the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a host for a feast of welcome in his palace, indicating a position of authority and hospitality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a noble figure associated with a palace, representing authority and power in Helium.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a royal figure who hosts a feast at his palace, demonstrating leadership and hospitality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a significant figure whose return to the _Xavarian_ is a key event in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a title held by the narrator, indicating a position of nobility and leadership in Helium.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a title indicating a high-ranking individual, a friend and companion to John Carter.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is a title indicating a person of noble status who is visiting Zat Arrras.&lt;SEP&gt;The Prince of Helium is the defendant in a trial, whose rights to a fair hearing are being advocated for by Kantos Kan and the public.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fec090a1531505a82f52e76f197bd709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b91c81842785853f1b7b9148297952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4c2a87c1f4e9cc424db7febe61149a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eff6289e379a5bbb6ce19b0dc88aa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57e6e909540039e4b0a0732f451c6013&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d29b3deb40d1b6cb2b5a52d0f968e28b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18baf96786d50da1cc2652ec45a9b1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41692485a75fafbf159b80ea98324da3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba6fe6e7d6d25df18260ffbf7692d4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f1a6e31899408aeeec6a28a06f7b62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f865b074dfa38019a0b7368edf0f019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd1b65dcd4e5b65f014a78dfad395fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce7b4df675ffbd231e4dfa153bac440</data>
    </node>
