      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The rack is a structure used to hold swords, indicating its function in organizing and storing weapons.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3df18cfd0c0768045a47b07a82fd2d43</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BATTLE ENGAGEMENT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Battle Engagement is the planned conflict where the First Born aims to break through the enemy lines and attack the Holy Therns.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-803a01fd429050acde727f1f5d0b80d5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BLACK PIRATES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Black Pirates are a hostile group from whom the narrator fears escape is unlikely.&lt;SEP&gt;Black Pirates are portrayed as incredibly fierce fighters, surpassing even the Green Martians in their ferocity.&lt;SEP&gt;Black Pirates are rumored inhabitants of the lesser moon, known for descending upon Barsoom to commit atrocities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates are a group conducting searches for fugitives and are involved in capturing individuals, including a young red woman.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates are a group that captured Dejah Thoris and another individual, showing their aggressive and controlling nature.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates are depicted as a group of antagonistic individuals attacking the narrator and Tars Tarkas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Pirates are mentioned as a threat, indicating their role as antagonists or enemies that need to be escaped from.&lt;SEP&gt;The black pirates are a group known for raiding the domains of the therns and capturing thern damsels, never taking men as prisoners.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f48c1d754d1ffb26016da528676dbc74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eee5f1ac2c6536f462bf6d2d2fb2ff7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b72dad86788b3397c84dad0327ae2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fae3b8c057c10806b8855546fa2a43e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6527f91419b819bb445cd47f8d793fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a59d3f0f2009f3a1a1e552d208e3e428&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be809390aed5cbcb14d9c180568ae323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78737f9e0a06b70a0bb9ae9555fd2498</data>
    </node>
