    </node>
    <node id="VALLEY OF DOR">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The Valley of Dor is an inner valley surrounded by the Otz Mountains, containing the Lost Sea of Korus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Valley of Dor is an inner valley surrounded by the Otz Mountains, known for its central location and challenging terrain.&lt;SEP&gt;The Valley of Dor is depicted as a place falsely known for love and peace, but is actually a deceptive and wicked location.&lt;SEP&gt;The Valley of Dor is described as a mythical place associated with love and peace, but also portrayed as deceptive and wicked.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-26ef0b24e731f9a32cfb495e4f895d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33f4de7021681b138c6572d77b66c4fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c2b778334955e9ced7c09bfb06c6e52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1589e9bc10a530649c9633fc000a9d</data>
    </node>
