    </node>
    <node id="SUPERSTITION">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Superstition refers to age-old beliefs influencing decisions and actions, potentially leading to dire consequences.&lt;SEP&gt;Superstition refers to the false belief system that the narrator wishes to disprove to the people of Barsoom.</data>
