      <data key="d1">The Stronghold of the Holy Therns is a significant location within the story, representing a place of power and challenge to overcome.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-75779c31636c7f365a9d05b913893782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THE VERDICT">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Verdict is the outcome of the tribunal against Helium's hero, prompting public reaction and opposition.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8a68ab2d56f3a58dae0859abb96ba81f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THOAT">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Thoat is a creature used for riding, which Sola uses to travel.&lt;SEP&gt;Thoats are creatures used as mounts, required by the party for transportation.</data>
