      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Secret Temples are hidden places controlled by the Holy Therns across various communities, indicating their extensive influence.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-75779c31636c7f365a9d05b913893782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HEAD OF THE NAVY">
      <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
      <data key="d1">The Head of the Navy is a position held by Kantos Kan, indicating military leadership and influence.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8a68ab2d56f3a58dae0859abb96ba81f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="HUDSON">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Hudson is the river flowing below the bluff where the narrator stands at the beginning of the story.&lt;SEP&gt;Hudson refers to the area near John Carter's cottage, where his body was found, suggesting a connection to his Earthly life.&lt;SEP&gt;Hudson refers to the banks of the Hudson River, where the narrator is currently located and experiences a vivid memory.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hudson is a river that is described as placid in the text, providing a geographical setting for the events.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hudson is described as a river flowing like a grey and silent spectre, evoking a sense of nostalgia and historical depth.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hudson refers to the Hudson River, near which John Carter's body was found twelve years prior, overlooking the river from a bluff.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43d3870029a94435f4a7808b5cc3561c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22e1ad1f3af901591bbdf5e3b5957aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d976a8fa9e1f5518efefe5f34b3de197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f39bd08780868fa3aa1cb9896c0f66bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0399b1611c31391a38e23605c6a4cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300d991e887f6e7a94ba6084446b534d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FIRST BLACK MAN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The First Black Man is the original being whose pure bloodline has remained untainted, leading to the formation of a distinct race on Barsoom.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a54ae772b882a5b23dec9acd964a9f8b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REVOLVING CHAMBER">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Revolving Chamber is a mysterious and ominous structure that is central to the events unfolding, with potentially horrible things occurring within it.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d1f7421e24bb6db8db2cf43cce33eb2d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THE WICKED-FACED MAN">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The Wicked-Faced Man is a white man with flowing yellow hair who appears to be in control of the secret doorway and is associated with directing and operating the movement of the door.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2a648d5f699056f4919135718d634cd3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IMPRISONED CREATURES">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Imprisoned Creatures refer to the beings that lived within hard shells on Barsoom before evolving into various forms of life.</data>
