    <node id="MARTIAN JUSTICE">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Martian Justice refers to the system of justice on Mars, where benefactors and malefactors are either rewarded or condemned.&lt;SEP&gt;Martian Justice refers to the system of justice on Mars, where benefactors and malefactors are judged and heroes are decorated.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9202971a6c9b597c032f8fde2a01d35a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-188e20abff12b91977ee19e7cec8de54</data>
