    <node id="THARKS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Tharks are a group or race to which Tars Tarkas belongs, indicating a structured society or organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Tharks are a group or society over which the Jeddak of the Tharks presides, suggesting a distinct cultural or social entity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tharks are a group or horde that Tars Tarkas leads, living on the dead sea bottom beyond Korad on Mars.</data>
