    <node id="SOLDIERY">
      <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
      <data key="d1">Soldiery refers to the ranks of soldiers present in the throne room, tasked with protecting Issus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Soldiery consists of heavily armed soldiers standing around Issus's throne, providing protection and maintaining order.</data>
