    <node id="AISLE OF HOPE">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Aisle of Hope is a significant location towards which Kantos Kan and his followers escort John Carter and his party.&lt;SEP&gt;The Aisle of Hope is a broad aisle within the great hall of the temple, leading to the platform where the trial is conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;The Aisle of Hope is a pathway or location within the temple, leading to a significant destination.&lt;SEP&gt;The Aisle of Hope represents the path taken by the protagonist and his allies during their triumphal march, symbolizing optimism and victory.</data>
