    </node>
    <node id="FATHER OF THERNS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The Father of Therns is a commanding figure who ordered the search for the two individuals from the outer world.&lt;SEP&gt;The Father of Therns is a title held by Matai Shang, signifying leadership and authority within the Therns hierarchy.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-70df0f7b7c4334f4d8af1b1558e02707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c22e4d87550fcfbcdf0c1e0d337db45</data>
