    <node id="THE CHAMBER OF MYSTERY">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Chamber of Mystery implies a location characterized by secrecy or unknown elements, potentially significant to the plot.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chamber of Mystery is the rocky room where the events unfold, including the ominous laugh and tense silence.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5122be51fbf9687e6937b89f972a742f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb47cc5ccb52b699a384237e299809c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="TEMPLE OF REWARD">
