      <data key="d1">Temple of Reward is a location mentioned by Hor Vastus as a place where he intends to reveal his plan to the public.&lt;SEP&gt;The Temple of Reward is a location on Mars where Martian justice is dispensed, including decorating heroes and condemning felons.&lt;SEP&gt;The Temple of Reward is a location where a significant event takes place, involving John Carter and the people of Helium.&lt;SEP&gt;The Temple of Reward is a location where significant events occur, indicating its importance in the storyline.&lt;SEP&gt;The Temple of Reward is a significant location mentioned in the context of future celebrations and announcements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Temple of Reward is the specific location where John Carter addresses the people of Helium.</data>
