      <data key="d1">Red Men are another group involved in the battle, charging into the temple's interior.&lt;SEP&gt;Red Men are described as farmers relying on water from reservoirs for irrigation, perceiving the water supply as a miracle.&lt;SEP&gt;Red Men are mentioned as having the power to read thoughts, indicating a significant ability within their society.&lt;SEP&gt;Red Men are the result of a partial amalgamation of the blacks, whites, and yellows, forming a splendid race on Mars.&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Men are a group mentioned in comparison to the Holy Therns and First Born, suggesting equality among them.&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Men are individuals from royal houses who are targeted by the First Born during raids, often capturing females and artisans.&lt;SEP&gt;The red men are inhabitants of Barsoom who could benefit greatly if the Valley Dor were opened to them by the expedition.</data>
