    <node id="BARSOOMIAN NAVAL WARFARE">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Barsoomian naval warfare is a type of combat strategy characterized by maneuvering and tactical formations, such as the circular formation described.&lt;SEP&gt;Barsoomian naval warfare is characterized by strategic maneuvers, such as forming a circle around the enemy during battle.</data>
