      <data key="d1">The Plant Man is a muscled and powerful entity that the narrator grapples with, showcasing strength and resilience.&lt;SEP&gt;The Plant Man is a type of creature with green, sticky juice, suggesting a non-human, plant-like entity involved in combat.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5ba237b787b6cfce17367d1ff451d624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f36761da5e5b5c98556663dbd06e0c3</data>
