    <node id="ZODANGAN">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Zodangan refers to a group or affiliation associated with Parthak, which Hor Vastus impersonates to gain Parthak's trust.&lt;SEP&gt;Zodangan refers to a group or entity that holds the narrator as a prisoner, and is associated with Zat Arrras.</data>
