    <node id="PARTHAK">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Parthak is a character who previously bore food to the narrator and wore a harness and sword, but has since been replaced by another jailer.&lt;SEP&gt;Parthak is a character who receives a harness and a short-sword from Carthoris as per the narrator's instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;Parthak is a character whose loyalty is questioned, and his fate is uncertain regarding his role as a traitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Parthak is a person to whom Carthoris is ordered to deliver a harness, indicating a task or mission.&lt;SEP&gt;Parthak is a youth who is loyal to Zat Arrras and is involved in delivering a message and retrieving harnesses and a jewelled short-sword.&lt;SEP&gt;Parthak is an individual whose removal is speculated to be connected to a note given to him, indicating a possible betrayal or shift in loyalty.&lt;SEP&gt;Parthak is described as a loyal individual who refuses to betray Zat Arrras, showing steadfast allegiance and integrity.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3e797ebb432bac2d42d4a50cdf4e2429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc762f5d59833da40830b39a8c156c55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca06d2e5dc124b584060a61efedd5b65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681e8c340ca9a7f2e14d3fcd3d71a3e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a0ba9e0d4459c3f9f24f06c81a870d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba36c52515135b93e6cffab3871259ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8827d6c7791b3b800c1f7855d869b563</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THE NOTE">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Note is a message given by the narrator to Parthak, potentially impacting his fate and that of others involved.&lt;SEP&gt;The Note is a message sent by the narrator to Carthoris, intended to communicate the narrator's situation and instructions.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-681e8c340ca9a7f2e14d3fcd3d71a3e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e797ebb432bac2d42d4a50cdf4e2429</data>
    </node>
