    <node id="GREAT BANTHS">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Great Banths are creatures that respond to unfamiliar odors and rush into the gardens, indicating their wild and instinctive nature.&lt;SEP&gt;Great Banths are fierce beasts that roam freely through the galleries, yet can be controlled by Thuvia.</data>
