      <data key="d1">Hybrids refer to the offspring of prisoners from the outside world, including red and green Martians and the white race of therns, living in an underground environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrids refer to the strange beings that are a mix of different races, resulting from the confinement of prisoners from the outside world.</data>
