      <data key="d1">The Underworld is a location characterized by dim corridors, prowling banths, and chambers containing prisoners and beasts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Underworld is the subterranean setting where the story takes place, inhabited by various strange beings and hybrids.&lt;SEP&gt;Underworld is the underground environment where the hybrids reside, described as a veritable hell.</data>
