    <node id="GUARD">
      <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
      <data key="d1">Guard is a soldier who roughly strips the trappings from Xodar and leads the narrator toward the gardens.&lt;SEP&gt;Guard is responsible for overseeing and directing individuals towards the arena, indicating a position of authority and control.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guard is responsible for inspecting and overseeing the prisoners, ensuring their confinement until the next day.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guard is responsible for maintaining order and security on the battleship, taking action to remove unwanted individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;The guard is responsible for watching over the gate of the cage that confines the victims, indicating a position of authority and control.</data>
