      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Barsoomians are the inhabitants of Barsoom who have a tradition of pilgrimaging to the Valley Dor at the end of their lives.&lt;SEP&gt;Barsoomians are the inhabitants of Barsoom, believed to be the same species as the First Born, but subject to the doctrine of voluntary pilgrimage.&lt;SEP&gt;Barsoomians refer to the inhabitants of Barsoom who have taken the voluntary pilgrimage down the River Iss.&lt;SEP&gt;Barsoomians refer to the inhabitants of the outer world who have been deceived into going to the Valley Dor.</data>
