    <node id="THE MAIDENS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The Maidens are a group of individuals who are being protected by the prisoners, indicating their significance and need for safeguarding.&lt;SEP&gt;The Maidens are a group of terror-stricken girls who are targeted by the monstrous white apes.&lt;SEP&gt;The maidens are the victims who are almost attacked by the apes and are saved by the protagonist.</data>
