      <data key="d1">Edgar Rice Burroughs is the author of "The Gods of Mars," known for works like "Tarzan of the Apes" and "A Princess of Mars."&lt;SEP&gt;Edgar Rice Burroughs is the author of 'The Gods of Mars', a renowned writer known for his science fiction and adventure novels.&lt;SEP&gt;Edgar Rice Burroughs is the author of 'The Gods of Mars,' a work of fiction available through Project Gutenberg.&lt;SEP&gt;Edgar Rice Burroughs is the author of the text "The Gods of Mars," a work of science fiction that is part of the Barsoom series.</data>
