    <node id="BANTH">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Banth is a creature depicted as a large, powerful beast with talons and fangs, capable of causing panic and chaos among humans.&lt;SEP&gt;The Banth is a fierce, many-legged beast of prey native to the low hills surrounding the dead seas of ancient Mars. It is nearly hairless, with a bristly mane around its neck, and possesses ten powerful legs, enormous jaws with multiple rows of needle-like fangs, and green protruding eyes.&lt;SEP&gt;The banth is described as a many-legged creature, suggesting it is a dangerous entity in the story.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fa38df0408d03dc87421f9da494e393f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-949dc44a1a314c18156adec10cd85e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4df2b18cd1896c0096f54e469a17bed</data>
    </node>
