      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Ten-man Cruiser is a vessel attempting to intercept the escape, representing organized resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ten-man cruiser is a vessel rising directly in front to cut off the escape, equipped with grappling hooks and posing a significant obstacle.</data>
