    <node id="HUMAN FLESH CONSUMPTION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Human Flesh Consumption is an event involving the Holy Therns, who eat flesh that has died beneath the sucking lips of a plant man.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5324db2140e850349d16bd6636e59321</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THE CAVE">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The Cave is a geographical feature that serves as a strategic location for the characters, requiring ingenuity to access it.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cave is a narrow cave located above a narrow ledge on the cliff's face, accessible by a branch used by the narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cave is a narrow opening located at the cliff's face, accessible from a ledge that the narrator reaches.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cave is a tunnel cut from a solid cliff, described as having high walls and an arched roof, and is being explored by the characters.</data>
