    <node id="ZITIDARS">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Zitidars are creatures corralled within the courtyards of the Warriors' Quarters, contributing to the characteristic sounds of Martian life.&lt;SEP&gt;Zitidars are creatures or animals that move restlessly in the inner court, possibly serving as beasts of burden or transport.&lt;SEP&gt;Zitidars are large creatures that move within the herd in the courtyard, sharing similarities with thoats in behavior.</data>
