    <node id="JEDDAK OF HELIUM">
      <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
      <data key="d1">Jeddak of Helium is a significant leadership position within the context of the story, indicating power and authority.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak of Helium is a title of leadership and power, desired by Zat Arrras and associated with significant influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak of Helium is a title or position of power that is central to the plot and the offer made by Zat Arrras.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak of Helium is a title or position, indicating leadership or authority within the context of Helium.&lt;SEP&gt;The Jeddak of Helium is a leader who offered rewards for the search of a missing individual, indicating authority and concern for the people of Barsoom.&lt;SEP&gt;The Jeddak of Helium is a title or position of leadership, under whose name Zat Arrras demands the surrender of Kantos Kan's group.&lt;SEP&gt;The title of Jeddak of Helium represents a position of authority or leadership, which Zat Arrras is ambitious to achieve.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9313680f9284277c6d0068f59907d106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe97f250482c686ce435b237250ec83f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3f1e23738091ab20178aeaf5ad79c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dd702bb82bfdc458cb9b1d6020448ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5e9d5b5bb51756648e7a02983977bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcf47f64aae75975f5f02f3ddf9a1b21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99c39c37bc3b545fc1976766cc4848db</data>
