    </node>
    <node id="PILGRIMAGE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Pilgrimage is the voluntary journey taken by Barsoomians down the River Iss, seeking love, peace, and happiness.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilgrimage refers to a journey or rite of passage that John Carter has not undertaken, which is notable within the narrative context.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilgrimage refers to the journey undertaken by Soomian, which he terminated at the Lost Sea.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilgrimage refers to the voluntary journey taken by Barsoomians to the Valley Dor, symbolizing their transition to peace and rest.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pilgrimage is a significant journey undertaken by Dejah Thoris and Sola, marking a pivotal event that influences various characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pilgrimage is a voluntary journey taken by creatures down the River of Mystery, often leading to subjugation or danger.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-40f45050d6a20b8b55e7285b8bb22a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7d066fee844e2d8100274ab66d09c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6337d09fdc42bf43f4adbf33b0f37655&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4946b446ccff9fda170ff24c30ed8581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f865b074dfa38019a0b7368edf0f019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5009e631aba3ff94894fe4081e86897a</data>
    </node>
