    </node>
    <node id="RIVER ISS">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">River Iss is a geographical location mentioned as a place where deluded voyagers might be escorted back to the outer world.&lt;SEP&gt;River Iss is a geographical location where Barsoomians undertake their pilgrimage, leading to the Valley Dor and the Lost Sea of Korus.&lt;SEP&gt;River Iss is a mysterious river mentioned in the text, associated with the Valley Dor and the Lost Sea of Korus.&lt;SEP&gt;River Iss is a river running beneath the ice field and below the Valley Otz, with a canyon that is open in the area described.&lt;SEP&gt;River Iss is a river that empties into the Lost Sea of Korus, associated with the Valley Dor.&lt;SEP&gt;River Iss is described as a geographical location, potentially significant within the narrative context.&lt;SEP&gt;The River Iss is a mysterious river associated with a final pilgrimage, suggesting cultural or spiritual significance in the narrative.</data>
