    <node id="THE FOREST">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The Forest is a dense area of foliage that reaches up to the base of the cliffs, with its lush greenery extending fully a thousand feet against the cliffs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is a geographical area near the cliff, serving as a potential refuge or strategic location for the characters involved.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is a geographical area that the Green Warrior attempts to reach for safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is a geographical location providing shadows and refuge from pursuers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is a geographical location where the Great Warrior hopes to find refuge and shelter from the pursuing plant men.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is a potential destination or refuge for the narrator and Tars Tarkas, representing safety or escape.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is described as a natural area providing a contrast to the meadow land and open sea, contributing to the landscape's beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forest is described as having dense foliage that reaches up to a thousand feet against a cliff, forming part of the natural landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;The forest is depicted as a carefully cultivated area with vast, high-ceilinged chambers and towering trees, indicating a sophisticated environment.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-325b26f02d17fd6347079d1ba4fad726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0974acb08da1b4c1b92c316af33a88e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-559d0add4d492cb1c4809fb59a95e633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e33671946ad4f4f5b2e6f996f2c859cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7cb29c22be9d31a0a3156fe8cf8b734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66578f685f96545725c6926095d5777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91e86645b0989df5782a6688160c1d8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c52ab8778aee4f0c53248a452d1143f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf097d75b2e15406baf64c8aff8191f</data>
    </node>
