    </node>
    <node id="JEDDAK">
      <data key="d0">ROLE</data>
      <data key="d1">A Jeddak is a high-ranking leader among the Martians, who inspires loyalty and devotion through their character and actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a leadership role in Helium, indicating a position of authority and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a leadership role in Helium, significant in the political hierarchy and central to the current power struggle.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a leadership role within the Thark community, responsible for negotiating with neighboring hordes and organizing warriors for expeditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a role of leadership or authority within Helium that is to be newly selected.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title for a leader or ruler who meets with jeds and lesser chieftains in an audience chamber.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title for a ruler or leader among the Martians, indicating a high-ranking position with authority over jeds and lesser chieftains.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title indicating a high-ranking leader, specifically of the Tharks, an indication of authority and leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title of leadership or rulership, possibly the ruler of Helium, whose absence creates uncertainty.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title of leadership within the society of Helium, held by the narrator as part of the House of Tardos Mors.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title of royalty or leadership within the society of Helium, indicating a position of power and influence.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title or role associated with leadership or rulership, possibly referring to a deceased or absent leader.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title or role held by John Carter, denoting his leadership or rulership, likely within Helium or Barsoom.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak is a title that denotes a leader or ruler, in this context likely referring to a high-ranking individual within a group or society on Barsoom.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak refers to a leadership role, possibly the ruler of a group or region, whose selection is a topic of conversation among the characters.&lt;SEP&gt;Jeddak refers to the leader or ruler of Helium, a role that holds significant power and responsibility.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-203aa795181a9eb1397b2f84beb7f517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c62fc6c1b0c8d44a0b390114bb7ef329&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5c94f3b5e290f5c1cd4a83a590d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e89417178bd5f0cae70e639617e8707&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b70f3d124e6dbcf1fbf9180293d455f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-495092be397283589740233519b5dcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ad7db4f246beb4b819a8f0994ae7c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dd3df1ac8a7347e4d559c5ff38864ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd72b265d18f8c068fcc7cb760ce09f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c1de3b9f0e7f1ea967106856be68ebb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34e6c74f70eb14cd86afae56d8763706&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c623b43139978dba5887d5c135e5174&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f804d99b0560937dece663ce5c7f98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2689f06a45abd5998519fb85220b9bd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43237e8924c3e87e804cbb4a0e2df875&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b41c4f89a372b142a32bb11bf4f3a03f</data>
    </node>
