    </node>
    <node id="GREAT PLANT MAN">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Great Plant Man represents a formidable adversary in the text, engaging in a struggle against the protagonist.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e8ab518ccfc750df1afb7beaaf9e5279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="THE CREATURE">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Creature is a fantastical being with human-shaped feet of monstrous proportions, a unique feeding method involving razorlike talons, and a massive tail with a flat, thin blade.&lt;SEP&gt;The Creature is a hideous entity with a hairless, blue body and a single protruding eye, described in detail to evoke horror and repulsion.&lt;SEP&gt;The Creature is a powerful being with a tail likened to a grizzly's arm, which the narrator confronts in battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Creature is described as having a fresh bullet wound, a face without a mouth, a head covered with writhing, worm-like hair, and human-like body and legs with exceptionally large feet.&lt;SEP&gt;The Creature is described as having sinuous, snakelike appendages and is engaged in running its hands over the sward, indicating its peculiar characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb2ecf848f0de73f4822e7c1b43abfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-459aa866f94fbb1f816c19ab635af138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c2359dee0ce37ca0f3edb6b25992150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ba237b787b6cfce17367d1ff451d624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ced04075a5d69c76ea7d1f05b087e34</data>
    </node>
