    </node>
    <node id="MARTIAN SWORD">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Martian sword is a weapon used by the narrator in combat, notable for its sharpness and effectiveness in battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Martian sword is a weapon wielded by the narrator, described as having a keen edge capable of parting a shoulder bone.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dda2ba13c7497352bcb94f3e493f8def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a0eb7e5b53ec81773729f65fca8a27</data>
