      <data key="d1">Thoris is a character who reacts with surprise upon seeing John Carter and is loyal, expressing a troubled look and concern for John Carter.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9582d5fbcd0fec18f551d2401616b736</data>
    </node>
