    <node id="BANTHS">
      <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
      <data key="d1">Banths are described as dangerous creatures that initially attempted to attack the girl but were cowed by her commanding presence.&lt;SEP&gt;Banths are fierce, snarling creatures that respond submissively to the young woman's commands.&lt;SEP&gt;Banths are great beasts that prowl the corridors at night, seeking prey, and are feared by the therns.&lt;SEP&gt;Banths are large creatures liberated in the garden, becoming angered and excited by the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;Banths are terrible creatures used as scavengers in the lower regions, feared by the therns and managed by characters like Sator Throg.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-42f063e8c8fb8dc754a765041b551fbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64474596228fc708f1e3fea89d9ec14b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d68959082a690bb8c58c37751492f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c83143cdd9a1d0eb60c6e662a220df1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cce5f2f43c58434ecb8ced8a101ae43</data>
    </node>
