    <node id="THE BATTLE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Battle is a conflict involving the Thark, during which Tan Gama's short-sword was broken.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battle is a violent conflict taking place in the room and across the gardens, involving multiple groups of warriors.</data>
