    <node id="KORUS">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Korus is a location on Mars, characterized by its crimson sward and gorgeous forest, inhabited by plant men.&lt;SEP&gt;Korus is a location with depths inhabited by slimy silians, indicating a possibly aquatic or mysterious setting.&lt;SEP&gt;Korus is another aspect of the religious doctrine influencing the officers on the _Xavarian_, demonstrating the power of belief systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Korus is depicted as a sea, serving as a geographic reference point in the narrative, possibly a location to reach for safety or escape.&lt;SEP&gt;Korus is mentioned as a location where some characters will awaken, suggesting its significance in the unfolding events.&lt;SEP&gt;Korus is referenced as a location to which a character is journeying, suggesting it is a significant place in the context of the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Korus represents a metaphorical or mythological place, possibly an afterlife or a final resting place.</data>
