    <node id="SOLA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Sola is a character who is involved in recounting the story of the pilgrimage and capture of Dejah Thoris, showing loyalty and concern for the Princess.&lt;SEP&gt;Sola is a green girl who rides a thoat and is involved in the search for the Princess of Helium.&lt;SEP&gt;Sola is a green woman and the daughter of Tars Tarkas, who accompanied Dejah Thoris on her disappearance.&lt;SEP&gt;Sola is the daughter of Tars Tarkas who accompanied Dejah Thoris on a pilgrimage, and her loss is deeply mourned by Tars Tarkas.&lt;SEP&gt;Sola is the daughter of Tars Tarkas, whose absence is felt as a loss among the characters.</data>
