    </node>
    <node id="ASSAULT ON ISSUS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Assault on Issus is a planned attack involving multiple groups and leaders, aimed at the Temple of Issus.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9ac788a7f0b0f7041a03297b242b6cad</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CAPTAIN JOHN CARTER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Captain John Carter is a character from Virginia who has a connection to Mars and has left notes about his experiences. He is depicted as having a deep bond with his family, choosing to stay with them on Barsoom, where lifespans are significantly long.&lt;SEP&gt;Captain John Carter is a man from Virginia, remembered for his mysterious life and peculiar instructions regarding his tomb.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-73f568e5559307a47b8b95fa17fa316c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae6ff778d2590cbe93dfbb660282da9a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="UTANS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The utans are individuals or a group being instructed to turn back and follow the speaker as a means of escape.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a2bea6eb93c07d5de217e100ae883e0c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="VIRGINIA">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Virginia is a geographical location associated with Captain John Carter, indicating his place of origin or residence.&lt;SEP&gt;Virginia is a location associated with John Carter, indicating his origin.&lt;SEP&gt;Virginia is the state where Captain John Carter was from, and where his tomb is located.</data>
