    </node>
    <node id="VOLUNTARY PILGRIMAGE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The voluntary pilgrimage is a journey undertaken by the people of Barsoom, leading them to a horrid fate due to deception.&lt;SEP&gt;Voluntary Pilgrimage refers to the journey undertaken by Dejah Thoris and her servants, from which none returns.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c94071ebf05790657895dd5a92350321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c60a9da7e3358ae80aa0dde32a451ee8</data>
