    <node id="RICHMOND">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">Richmond is a location where Captain John Carter left his notes, specifically in a hotel room, suggesting its relevance in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;Richmond is the city in Virginia where the cemetery containing Captain John Carter's mausoleum is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Richmond is the city where the meeting with John Carter takes place, indicating a significant event.&lt;SEP&gt;Richmond is the location of the hotel where E. R. B. left his notes about the story.</data>
