    <edge source="PRINCE" target="THUVIA">
      <data key="d3">67.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Thuvia addresses the narrator as Prince, indicating respect or acknowledgment of their role.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia engages the Prince in conversation to help him understand the strategic importance of guarding the therns' domains.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia expresses a desire to serve the Prince, who offers her a future of equality and honor rather than servitude.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia expresses relief and gratitude upon seeing the Prince, indicating a possible alliance or shared goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia guides the Prince and others through the stronghold of the Holy Therns, showing leadership and support.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia identifies the resemblance between the Prince and the Holy Thern, suggesting a strategic use of this resemblance to achieve their goal.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia provides the Prince with information on the escape route, indicating a collaborative effort in navigating the stronghold.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia wakes the Prince to warn him of a potential danger, indicating her role in protecting the leader.&lt;SEP&gt;Thuvia warns the Prince about the potential danger posed by the therns, indicating a shared concern for their safety.</data>
      <data key="d5">alliance, shared goals&lt;SEP&gt;caution, shared fate&lt;SEP&gt;devotion, equality&lt;SEP&gt;guidance, collaboration&lt;SEP&gt;guidance, leadership&lt;SEP&gt;guidance, strategic understanding&lt;SEP&gt;protection, vigilance&lt;SEP&gt;respect, acknowledgment&lt;SEP&gt;strategy, resemblance</data>
