      <data key="d4">John Carter believes he is on Barsoom, highlighting his connection to this location.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter frequently travels to Barsoom and feels a strong connection to the planet, which he considers his home.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter has had significant adventures on Barsoom, impacting its society and environment.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter has previously saved Barsoom from a painless death and now seeks to save it from a more frightful form of death.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter is a key figure navigating the challenges of Barsoom, showcasing his skills and bravery.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter is a notable figure on Barsoom, showcasing his skills and status on this planet.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter is celebrated as the savior of Barsoom, having unlocked the secret of life for its inhabitants.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter is deeply connected to Barsoom, having made sacrifices for its people and earning their respect.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter is mentioned as being absent from Barsoom, which is noteworthy to the Therns.&lt;SEP&gt;John Carter rose from a prisoner among the green men to a high place among the highest of Barsoom.</data>
