      <data key="d4">Zat Arrras acts in the name of the Jeddak of Helium, suggesting a hierarchical relationship or command.&lt;SEP&gt;Zat Arrras is ambitious to attain the title of Jeddak of Helium, indicating a pursuit of power.&lt;SEP&gt;Zat Arrras is aware of the plot to make the narrator Jeddak of Helium and uses it as leverage in his offer.</data>
      <data key="d5">ambition, power pursuit&lt;SEP&gt;hierarchy, command&lt;SEP&gt;power dynamics, political intrigue</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-8dd702bb82bfdc458cb9b1d6020448ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe97f250482c686ce435b237250ec83f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcf47f64aae75975f5f02f3ddf9a1b21</data>
