    <edge source="ZAT ARRRAS" target="HOR VASTUS">
      <data key="d3">37.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Hor Vastus encounters a Zodangan soldier while accessing the pits beneath the palace occupied by Zat Arrras.&lt;SEP&gt;Hor Vastus has a plan to thwart Zat Arrras' ambitions and intends to reveal it publicly, indicating opposition to Zat Arrras.&lt;SEP&gt;Hor Vastus identifies a spy associated with Zat Arrras, indicating a connection between them.&lt;SEP&gt;Hor Vastus identifies the fallen individual as one of Zat Arrras' spies, showing awareness of Zat Arrras' activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Zat Arrras might have Hor Vastus as a prisoner or victim, indicating a conflict or threat between them.</data>
      <data key="d5">access, conflict&lt;SEP&gt;awareness, opposition&lt;SEP&gt;conflict, imprisonment&lt;SEP&gt;espionage, identification&lt;SEP&gt;opposition, strategy</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ebd37ffff0b33a7e235d87ed7805fbdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77692e6ffddee71d84df4019bdaed98d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5e9d5b5bb51756648e7a02983977bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab94c046d5beb01dc5019acc856391f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f804d99b0560937dece663ce5c7f98</data>
